# .env - defaults for this sub-daemon (a value the daemon above already passed down wins); every agent under it inherits them.
# AOS_CLOCK and AOS_LLM_KERNEL come from the daemon above; not set here on purpose: the clock is only in the root.
# AOS_HOME is the proto8 folder these files point into; export it, or uncomment the next line and set it here.
# AOS_HOME=${HOME}/repo/aos/proto8
AOS_HOME=${AOS_HOME}
